<BaseLayout title="About · Lorien Lab" description="About Lorien Lab's quantitative research interests and research philosophy."><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="mono-label">About</div><h1>Quant research as<br/>a system of evidence.</h1><p>I am interested in the full research loop: turning market hypotheses into measurable features, testing them under realistic constraints, and building infrastructure that makes the process reproducible.</p></div></header><section class="section"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="about-copy"><h2>Research philosophy</h2><p>Good quantitative research is more than finding a backtest that works. It requires clear economic intuition, careful data construction, strong leakage controls, robust validation, and a way to understand why a signal succeeds or fails.</p><p>My current interests sit at the intersection of factor discovery, futures term structure, market microstructure, CTA-style systematic strategies, machine learning, and agent-assisted research infrastructure.</p><p>I also care about the engineering layer around research: experiment lineage, modular operators, factor libraries, de-duplication, and interfaces that help humans and agents work on the same research objects without losing auditability.</p></div><aside class="about-aside card"><div class="mono-label">Current themes</div><ul><li>Automated alpha discovery</li><li>Futures curve and spread states</li><li>Intraday → daily factor aggregation</li><li>Systematic trend and reversal</li><li>LLM / RL / GP search algorithms</li><li>Research platform architecture</li></ul></aside></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:65px;align-items:start}.about-copy h2{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}.about-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.about-aside{padding:24px;box-shadow:none}.about-aside ul{margin:18px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.about-aside li{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:650;font-size:.9rem}.about-aside li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}@media(max-width:760px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style>
